# GitHub 读到这个文件会在仓库页显示「Cite this repository」按钮,
# Zenodo 归档时也会用它生成 DOI 元数据。
# 引用格式是外链的载体 —— 别人引用我们时,链接就来了。
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this algorithm or the accompanying data snapshots, please cite it as below."
title: "FXCN forex broker rating algorithm"
abstract: >-
  Open-source scoring algorithm behind fxcn.com's forex broker ratings, with the
  rule file, a zero-dependency reference implementation, and public data
  snapshots. Every published score is independently reproducible: one command
  recomputes all broker scores from the snapshot and compares them against the
  live site, exiting non-zero if any single broker disagrees.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-28"
url: "https://fxcn.com/algorithm"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fxcn-algorithm/algorithm"
authors:
  - name: "FXCN"
    website: "https://fxcn.com"
keywords:
  - forex
  - broker rating
  - financial regulation
  - reproducible research
  - open data
  - investor protection
references:
  - type: data
    title: "FXCN jurisdiction protection dataset"
    abstract: >-
      Retail client protection rules across 28 forex regulatory jurisdictions:
      leverage caps, investor compensation schemes and negative balance
      protection, each record carrying the regulator source URL and check date.
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    url: "https://fxcn.com/en/data"
    authors:
      - name: "FXCN"
